 talisman seen throughout the Garden of Grotesqueries, with various messages written on them: Timetables, notes, tips, prohibitions... Endowed with meaning by the hand of man, it stubbornly refuses to leave anyone that it sticks to.","abilities":["Destroyed after taking a certain number of attacks","When attached to a target, deals Arts damage every second and prevents them from using skills"],"levelCount":1,"level":0,"levelAssumed":false,"statsOverridden":false,"moveSpeed":1,"stats":{"hp":12,"atk":40,"def":100,"res":30,"elementalRes":null,"elementalDamageRes":null,"attackInterval":1}},"rainer_haribeast":{"slug":"rainer_haribeast","name":"Rainer Haribeast","icon":"/enemies-icons/Rainer Haribeast.webp","rank":"Elite","race":null,"movement":"Ground","attackPosition":"Ranged","damageType":["Physical"],"flavourText":"A variety of haribeast growing unusual thorns, which can be shot at speeds rivaling that of arrows. Minute barbs grow on the tips, leaving wounds that fail to heal long after the skin is broken. Once, someone announced they'd successfully tamed one of these creatures; afterwards, they were never seen again.","abilities":["Weak spot located on its front, damage dealt to the rear is decreased","Deals damage in a semicircle to the rear at every fixed portion of health lost"],"levelCount":1,"level":0,"levelAssumed":false,"statsOverridden":false,"moveSpeed":0.3,"stats":{"hp":35000,"atk":720,"def":150,"res":8,"elementalRes":null,"elementalDamageRes":null,"attackInterval":3.5}},"fatty":{"slug":"fatty","name":"Fatty","icon":"/enemies-icons/Fatty.webp","rank":"Elite","race":null,"movement":"Ground","attackPosition":null,"damageType":["No Damage"],"flavourText":"Duck Lord's associate and apprentice, an opportunist with a slick tongue. Frequently appears on dubious TV shows, preaching about how he cares little for losses or gains, as they are part of the natural money-making process.","abilities":["Always faces the direction with the most Operators.","Takes 80% less P